window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>My name is Harley, and I’m the only Omega cage fighter.</p> <p>I won’t be tamed. I destroy my nest. But I’m falling hard for my scent matched Alpha, who is trapped alongside me in the underground fight club.</p> <p><i>He’s feral.</i></p> <p>He’s a savage, silent champion in the cage. But outside it, he’d burn the world to protect me from my mafia pack. We create a found family with our sunny best friend, a Beta medic with mesmerizing blue eyes.</p> <p>When a beautiful, billionaire male Omega is kidnapped and dragged into our dark world to be offered as a prize, I’m shocked that he’s my soulmate. Yet my mysterious enemy, a tattooed Alpha with deadly secrets, is battling to win him…and fracture our bonds.</p> <p>I’m risking everything to save my new pack. But when my heat hits at the worst possible moment, who will save <i>me</i>?</p> <p>Harley. Her ferals. A pack bond that changes everything.</p>"; 
